{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y2qNiuiSDkwD95YYCxr4CB","type":"tool_result","content":"655\t     :read-ledger! (if fork?\n656\t                     (fn [] nil)\n657\t                     (ledger-reader (:authority c) (:identity c)))\n658\t     :enroll! (when-not fork? (fn [] (authority/enroll! (:authority c))))}))\n659\t\n660\t\n661\t(def ^:private holder-config-keys\n662\t  \"The keys a holder/source config may carry: the checkpoint (bytes and\n663\t   address), the source's machine, the arbitration decision\n664\t   (arbitration-of's, never the caller's), the protection declaration,\n665\t   the receiving machine, the receiver's own attach/observe/serve seams,\n666\t   an optional renewal-interval override, and an optional :inbound stream\n667\t   (consumed by holder-media, not passed to the driver).  Every other key\n668\t   -- :journal, :reply-inbox, :outcome-inbox, :read-ledger!,\n669\t   :append-request!, :append-diagnostic!, :clock, :store, :medium, :me,\n670\t   :units, :source-index, :enroll!, :journals -- is a composition seam,\n671\t   refused at add-holder, never overridable by a holder config.\"\n672\t  [:bytes :address :machine :arbitration :protection :receiver\n673\t   :attach! :observe! :serve! :renewal-interval :inbound])\n674\t\n675\t\n676\t(defn- check-holder-config-keys!\n677\t  \"Refuse a holder config that carries a key outside holder-config-keys:\n678\t   each such key is a composition seam the holder may not supply.\"\n679\t  [h config]\n680\t  (let [allowed (set holder-config-keys)]\n681\t    (doseq [k (keys config)]\n682\t      (check! (contains? allowed k)\n683\t              (str \"a holder config of only the documented holder keys; \"\n684\t                   (pr-str k) \" is a composition seam\")\n685\t              {:holder h :key k}))))\n686\t\n687\t\n688\t(defn- driver-config\n689\t  \"The landed driver's config for holder `h`: the composition's seams and\n690\t   media, then the holder's own keys from `config` (holder-config-keys\n691\t   less :inbound) -- a holder config cannot substitute a composition seam,\n692\t   because add-holder refuses any key outside holder-config-keys first.\"\n693\t  [c h media config]\n694\t  (merge {:me h\n695\t          :renewal-interval (:renewal-interval c)\n696\t          :units (:units c)\n697\t          :source-index (:source-index c)\n698\t          :clock (:clock c)\n699\t          :store (:store c)\n700\t          :medium (:medium c)\n701\t          :journal (:journal media)\n702\t          :append-request! (fn [request]\n703\t                             (stream/append! (:inbound media) request))\n704\t          :reply-inbox (:reply-inbox media)\n705\t          :outcome-inbox (:outcome-inbox media)\n706\t          :read-ledger! (:read-ledger! media)\n707\t          :append-diagnostic! (fn [d] (stream/append! (:diagnostics c) d))}\n708\t         (select-keys config (disj (set holder-config-keys) :inbound))\n709\t         (when-some [enroll! (:enroll! media)]\n710\t           {:enroll! enroll!})))\n711\t\n712\t\n713\t(defn- front-of\n714\t  \"The holder's front over its media: the resolver names this holder"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b306c61e-3078-4fbf-aeb8-718be5db0962","uuid":"062dd56e-0000-4c10-889a-b2981938347a","timestamp":"2026-10-13T14:29:08.977Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p7c/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/compose.cljc","content":"     :read-ledger! (if fork?\n                     (fn [] nil)\n                     (ledger-reader (:authority c) (:identity c)))\n     :enroll! (when-not fork? (fn [] (authority/enroll! (:authority c))))}))\n\n\n(def ^:private holder-config-keys\n  \"The keys a holder/source config may carry: the checkpoint (bytes and\n   address), the source's machine, the arbitration decision\n   (arbitration-of's, never the caller's), the protection declaration,\n   the receiving machine, the receiver's own attach/obser