{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019cfUFCK7Ctjm1BuueQ7YWn","type":"tool_result","content":"1920\t(defn- accept-grant!\n1921\t  \"The grant checks of a blocked or parked exclusive root (handoff.cljc's\n1922\t   accept-grant!, ported verbatim, keyed off the root's custody slot c and\n1923\t   the carrier's pack address): evidence, binding, lease, holder,\n1924\t   arbitration, epoch, tenure and the input prefix; then protection in both\n1925\t   directions over every stream row of the tree, and op-id presence equal\n1926\t   to enrollment on every retained write. Answers the custody state the\n1927\t   restored root holds, its counter the slot's exactly.\"\n1928\t  [task c address opts]\n1929\t  (let [grant (:grant opts)\n1930\t        evidence (:evidence grant)]\n1931\t    (when-not (and (or (nil? grant) (map? grant))\n1932\t                   (or (nil? evidence) (map? evidence)))\n1933\t      (throw (ex-info \"Malformed lower grant or evidence\" {})))\n1934\t    (when-not evidence\n1935\t      (outcome! :yin.k/awaiting-grant nil {}))\n1936\t    (when-not (= :yin.k/ready (:yin.k/status evidence))\n1937\t      (outcome! (if (= :yin.k/awaiting-grant (:yin.k/status evidence))\n1938\t                  :yin.k/awaiting-grant :yin.k/unsatisfied)\n1939\t                nil (dissoc evidence :yin.k/status)))\n1940\t    (let [binding (:yin.k/binding evidence)\n1941\t          prefix (:yin.k/prefix evidence)\n1942\t          tenure (:tenure grant)\n1943\t          occurrence (:yin.k/occurrence c)\n1944\t          lease (:dao.lease/lease grant)\n1945\t          holder (:dao.lease/holder grant)\n1946\t          frontier (:yin.k/frontier prefix)\n1947\t          records (:yin.k/inputs prefix)]\n1948\t      (when-not (and (map? binding) (map? tenure))\n1949\t        (throw (ex-info \"Malformed lower binding or tenure\" {})))\n1950\t      (when (or (nil? prefix) (:yin.k/status prefix))\n1951\t        (outcome! :yin.k/unsatisfied nil {:yin.k/reason (or (:yin.k/reason prefix) :unavailable)}))\n1952\t      (when-not (and (= (:checkpoint grant) address)\n1953\t                     (= occurrence (:yin.k/occurrence binding))\n1954\t                     (some? lease) (= lease (:dao.lease/lease binding))\n1955\t                     (some? holder) (= holder (:dao.lease/holder binding))\n1956\t                     (= (get-in c [:yin.k/arbitration :dao.stream/identity])\n1957\t                        (get-in binding [:yin.k/transaction :yin.k/arbitration]))\n1958\t                     (custody/exact? (:yin.k/epoch binding))\n1959\t                     (true? (:live tenure))\n1960\t                     (number? (:now tenure)) (number? (:bound tenure))\n1961\t                     (< (:now tenure) (:bound tenure))\n1962\t                     (= occurrence (:yin.k/occurrence prefix))\n1963\t                     (= lease (:dao.lease/lease prefix))\n1964\t                     (custody/exact? frontier) (vector? records)\n1965\t                     (= frontier (count records))\n1966\t                     (every? true? (map-indexed\n1967\t                                     (fn [index record]\n1968\t                                       (and (custody/exact? (:yin.k/input-seq record))\n1969\t                                            (= index (:yin.k/input-seq record))))\n1970\t                                     records)))\n1971\t        (outcome! :yin.k/not-holder nil {}))\n1972\t      (let [classes (:protection opts)\n1973\t            enrolled (:yin.k/enrolled evidence)]\n1974\t        (when-not (and (map? classes)\n1975\t                       (every? #{:enrolled :at-least-once :fail-stop} (vals classes))\n1976\t                       (set? enrolled))\n1977\t          (throw (ex-info \"Malformed lower protection or enrollment\" {})))\n1978\t        (doseq [s (rows-of task :stream false)]\n1979\t          (let [identity (first (:slots s))\n1980\t                class (get classes identity)]\n1981\t            (when-not (and class (= (= class :enrolled) (contains? enrolled identity)))\n1982\t              (outcome! :yin.k/unsatisfied nil {:dao.stream/identity identity}))))\n1983\t        (doseq [[t _] (task-tree task :root)\n1984\t                w (nth (:slots t) 13)\n1985\t                :let [ss (:slots (second (:slots w)))\n1986\t                      [ti _ oi] (get write-slots (first ss))]\n1987\t                :when ti]\n1988\t          (let [identity (first (:slots (nth ss ti)))]\n1989\t            (when-not (= (= :enrolled (get classes identity)) (some? (nth ss oi)))\n1990\t              (outcome! :yin.k/unsatisfied nil {:dao.stream/identity identity}))))\n1991\t        {:yin.k/occurrence occurrence\n1992\t         :dao.lease/lease lease :dao.lease/holder holder\n1993\t         :yin.k/epoch (:yin.k/epoch binding)\n1994\t         :yin.k/arbitration (:yin.k/arbitration c)\n1995\t         :yin.k/next-op-seq (:yin.k/next-op-seq c)\n1996\t         :protection classes :input {:next 0 :prefix prefix}\n1997\t         :tenure {:bound (:bound tenure)}}))))\n1998\t\n1999\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b306c61e-3078-4fbf-aeb8-718be5db0962","uuid":"cbe73672-8fce-42bf-a6a8-1f374d8063ca","timestamp":"2026-10-13T14:29:49.388Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p7c/src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/rows.cljc","content":"(defn- accept-grant!\n  \"The grant checks of a blocked or parked exclusive root (handoff.cljc's\n   accept-grant!, ported verbatim, keyed off the root's custody slot c and\n   the carrier's pack address): evidence, binding, lease, holder,\n   arbitration, epoch, tenure and the input prefix; then protection in both\n   directions over every stream row of the tree, and op-id presence equal\n   to enrollment on every retained write. Answers the custody state the\n   restored root holds, its counter the slot's exactly.\"\n  [task c address opts]\n  (let [grant (:grant opts)\n        evidence (:evidence grant)]\n    (when-not (and (or (nil? grant) (map? grant))\n                   (or (nil? evidence) (map? evidence)))\n      (throw (ex-info \"Malformed lower grant or evidence\" {})))\n    (when-not evidence\n      (outcome! :yin.k/awaiting-grant nil {}))\n    (when-not (= :yin.k/ready (:yin.k/status evidence))\n      (outcome! (if (= :yin.k/awaiting-grant (:yin.k/status evidence))\n                  :yin.k/awaiting-grant :yin.k/unsatisfied)\n                nil (dissoc evidence :yin.k/status)))\n    (let [binding (:yin.k/binding evidence)\n          prefix (:yin.k/prefix evidence)\n          tenure (:tenure grant)\n          occurrence (:yin.k/occurrence c)\n          lease (:dao.lease/lease grant)\n          holder (:dao.lease/holder grant)\n          frontier (:yin.k/frontier prefix)\n          records (:yin.k/inputs prefix)]\n      (when-not (and (map? binding) (map? tenure))\n        (throw (ex-info \"Malformed lower binding or tenure\" {})))\n      (when (or (nil? prefix) (:yin.k/status prefix))\n        (outcome! :yin.k/unsatisfied nil {:yin.k/reason (or (:yin.k/reason prefix) :unavailable)}))\n      (when-not (and (= (:checkpoint grant) address)\n                     (= occurrence (:yin.k/occurrence binding))\n                     (some? lease) (= lease (:dao.lease/lease binding))\n                     (some? holder) (= holder (:dao.lease/holder binding))\n                     (= (get-in c [:yin.k/arbitration :dao.stream/identity])\n                        (get-in binding [:yin.k/transaction :yin.k/arbitration]))\n                     (custody/exact? (:yin.k/epoch binding))\n                     (true? (:live tenure))\n                     (number? (:now tenure)) (number? (:bound tenure))\n                     (< (:now tenure) (:bound tenure))\n                     (= occurrence (:yin.k/occurrence prefix))\n                     (= lease (:dao.lease/lease prefix))\n                     (custody/exact? frontier) (vector? records)\n                     (= frontier (count records))\n                     (every? true? (map-indexed\n                                     (fn [index record]\n                                       (and (custody/exact? (:yin.k/input-seq record))\n                                            (= index (:yin.k/input-seq record))))\n                                     records)))\n        (outcome! :yin.k/not-holder nil {}))\n      (let [classes (:protection opts)\n            enrolled (:yin.k/enrolled evidence)]\n        (when-not (and (map? classes)\n                       (every? #{:enrolled :at-least-once :fail-stop} (vals classes))\n                       (set? enrolled))\n          (throw (ex-info \"Malformed lower protection or enrollment\" {})))\n        (doseq [s (rows-of task :stream false)]\n          (let [identity (first (:slots s))\n                class (get classes identity)]\n            (when-not (and class (= (= class :enrolled) (contains? enrolled identity)))\n              (outcome! :yin.k/unsatisfied nil {:dao.stream/identity identity}))))\n        (doseq [[t _] (task-tree task :root)\n                w (nth (:slots t) 13)\n                :let [ss (:slots (second (:slots w)))\n                      [ti _ oi] (get write-slots (first ss))]\n                :when ti]\n          (let [identity (first (:slots (nth ss ti)))]\n            (when-not (= (= :enrolled (get classes identity)) (some? (nth ss oi)))\n              (outcome! :yin.k/unsatisfied nil {:dao.stream/identity identity}))))\n        {:yin.k/occurrence occurrence\n         :dao.lease/lease lease :dao.lease/holder holder\n         :yin.k/epoch (:yin.k/epoch binding)\n         :yin.k/arbitration (:yin.k/arbitration c)\n         :yin.k/next-op-seq (:yin.k/next-op-seq c)\n         :protection classes :input {:next 0 :prefix prefix}\n         :tenure {:bound (:bound tenure)}}))))\n\n","numLines":80,"startLine":1920,"totalLines":2263}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019cfUFCK7Ctjm1BuueQ7YWn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
